{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（15日）早上7時24分，東涌交匯處迴旋處有的士與電單車相撞，其中電單車翻倒地上，鐵騎士腳部受傷。救援人員到場替傷者包紮，然後將他送院；意</p><p>救援人員到場替傷者包紮，然後將他送院；意外導致現場交通擠塞。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131867730224353280048395.jpeg/6jtZitM8di2mEPSmucMBmCj73KMVuGAMOk9VPDpPVTw\" alt=\"現場交通擠塞。\"><figcaption>現場交通擠塞。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131867487290265600509247.jpeg/dbWGgmVspuQ8Xl5mnQ4stBQ8mVaLs_9xq5gEP6uYBD8\" alt=\"警員在場調查。\"><figcaption>警員在場調查。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1131867122507452416925461.jpeg/S7XTga6iEbM3TLOedk4_j4GCjFxLDvpK3clnut3JZ7o\" alt=\"的士與電單車相撞，電單車倒地。\"><figcaption>的士與電單車相撞，電單車倒地。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-15T00:36:45.446422+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":3,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}